    "overview": "Build a reliable and efficient desktop PC with the Intex IT-1802 Computer Cabinet with Standard SMPS. Designed with a durable SPCC 0.3 mm heavy-duty steel body, this cabinet offers excellent protection, efficient cooling, and a modern aesthetic for home, office, and business use. The IT-1802 supports Micro ATX and ITX motherboards and comes equipped with a Standard ATX SMPS for dependable power delivery. Its CPU/PCI heat vent design, superior airflow, and multiple front USB ports ensure smooth performance and convenient connectivity. The stylish front panel with integrated ventilation enhances cooling while giving the cabinet a premium appearance. Whether you're assembling a new PC or upgrading an existing one, the Intex IT-1802 provides the ideal balance of durability, functionality, and value.",
